-- Cleans up artist names already stored in festival_editions.program.
-- Nothing is added or removed beyond duplicates -- only the names change.
--
-- 1. Strips a leading clock time baked into the artist name
--    ('20:30 Lea Maria Fries' -> 'Lea Maria Fries'): 235 entries across 9
--    festivals, worst is Sweden Rock Festival with 95. A time inside the
--    name makes the act unfindable in the app's artist search.
-- 2. Rewrites SHOUTED names to normal case, but ONLY where the same name
--    already appears in mixed case somewhere else in the database -- proof
--    the capitals are a scraping artefact, not the artist's own styling.
--    887 entries. Names that exist only in capitals (BABYMETAL, CMAT,
--    KI/KI, P.O.D., BLOF, TV-2, SPFDJ ...) are deliberately untouched.
-- 3. Drops 10 duplicates that steps 1-2 collapsed onto the same day.
--
-- stage/time stay null throughout.
-- Del 3 av 5: 26 utgaver.

update festival_editions e set
  program = v.program,
  updated_at = now()
from (values
